  maskName: Ifrit's Mask
  maskType: 2
  maskIcon: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'Aspect of destruction and unrestrained power.


    This mask channels
    the fury of Ifrit, the embodiment of flame and wrath.

    When worn, power surges
    violently through the bearer, turning every action into an eruption.

    Strength
    grows through aggression, but control is constantly threatened.


    Ifrit does
    not grant power he unleashes it.'
